      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Plasma-free tryptophan is inversely related to the severity of subjective pain in 8 patients who fulfilled criteria for a variety of non-articular rheumatism, the \"fibrositis syndrome\". The observation is consistent with animal and human studies suggesting a relationship between reduced brain serotonin metabolism and pain reactivity."},
